      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a strong start. i like the phrasing. for the next part of the manifesto, can you add a section that specifically addresses the 'opponents' of this movement? like, why are people who want to keep the current system in place fundamentally wrong or even dangerous for the future? i want to make sure the manifesto shuts down their arguments before they even make them.",
